{
  "dhp334:0.1": "",
  "dhp334:0.2": "",
  "dhp334:0.3": "24. Taṇhāvaggo ",
  "dhp334:0.4": "334. ",
  "dhp334:1": "Manujassa pamattacārino, ",
  "dhp334:2": "taṇhā vaḍḍhati māluvā viya; ",
  "dhp334:3": "So plavatī hurā huraṃ, ",
  "dhp334:4": "phalamicchaṃva vanasmi vānaro. ",
  "dhp335:1": "335. Yaṃ esā sahate jammī, ",
  "dhp335:2": "taṇhā loke visattikā; ",
  "dhp335:3": "Sokā tassa pavaḍḍhanti, ",
  "dhp335:4": "abhivaṭṭhaṃva bīraṇaṃ. ",
  "dhp336:1": "336. Yo cetaṃ sahate jammiṃ, ",
  "dhp336:2": "taṇhaṃ loke duraccayaṃ; ",
  "dhp336:3": "Sokā tamhā papatanti, ",
  "dhp336:4": "udabinduva pokkharā. ",
  "dhp337:1": "337. Taṃ vo vadāmi bhaddaṃ vo, ",
  "dhp337:2": "yāvantettha samāgatā; ",
  "dhp337:3": "Taṇhāya mūlaṃ khaṇatha, ",
  "dhp337:4": "usīratthova bīraṇaṃ; ",
  "dhp337:5": "Mā vo naḷaṃva sotova, ",
  "dhp337:6": "māro bhañji punappunaṃ. ",
  "dhp338:0": "",
  "dhp338:1": "338. Yathāpi mūle anupaddave daḷhe, ",
  "dhp338:2": "chinnopi rukkho punareva rūhati; ",
  "dhp338:3": "Evampi taṇhānusaye anūhate, ",
  "dhp338:4": "nibbattatī dukkhamidaṃ punappunaṃ. ",
  "dhp339:1": "339. Yassa chattiṃsati sotā, ",
  "dhp339:2": "manāpasavanā bhusā; ",
  "dhp339:3": "Māhā vahanti duddiṭṭhiṃ, ",
  "dhp339:4": "saṅkappā rāganissitā. ",
  "dhp340:1": "340. Savanti sabbadhi sotā, ",
  "dhp340:2": "latā uppajja tiṭṭhati; ",
  "dhp340:3": "Tañca disvā lataṃ jātaṃ, ",
  "dhp340:4": "mūlaṃ paññāya chindatha. ",
  "dhp341:1": "341. Saritāni sinehitāni ca, ",
  "dhp341:2": "somanassāni bhavanti jantuno; ",
  "dhp341:3": "Te sātasitā sukhesino, ",
  "dhp341:4": "te ve jātijarūpagā narā. ",
  "dhp342:1": "342. Tasiṇāya purakkhatā pajā, ",
  "dhp342:2": "parisappanti sasova bandhito ; ",
  "dhp342:3": "Saṃyojanasaṅgasattakā, ",
  "dhp342:4": "dukkhamupenti punappunaṃ cirāya. ",
  "dhp343:1": "343. Tasiṇāya purakkhatā pajā, ",
  "dhp343:2": "parisappanti sasova bandhito; ",
  "dhp343:3": "Tasmā tasiṇaṃ vinodaye, ",
  "dhp343:4": "ākaṅkhanta virāgamattano. ",
  "dhp344:0": "",
  "dhp344:1": "344. Yo nibbanatho vanādhimutto, ",
  "dhp344:2": "vanamutto vanameva dhāvati; ",
  "dhp344:3": "Taṃ puggalametha passatha, ",
  "dhp344:4": "mutto bandhanameva dhāvati. ",
  "dhp345:0": "",
  "dhp345:1": "345. Na taṃ daḷhaṃ bandhanamāhu dhīrā, ",
  "dhp345:2": "yadāyasaṃ dārujapabbajañca ; ",
  "dhp345:3": "Sārattarattā maṇikuṇḍalesu, ",
  "dhp345:4": "puttesu dāresu ca yā apekkhā. ",
  "dhp346:1": "346. Etaṃ daḷhaṃ bandhanamāhu dhīrā, ",
  "dhp346:2": "ohārinaṃ sithilaṃ duppamuñcaṃ; ",
  "dhp346:3": "Etampi chetvāna paribbajanti, ",
  "dhp346:4": "anapekkhino kāmasukhaṃ pahāya. ",
  "dhp347:0": "",
  "dhp347:1": "347. Ye rāgarattānupatanti sotaṃ, ",
  "dhp347:2": "sayaṃkataṃ makkaṭakova jālaṃ; ",
  "dhp347:3": "Etampi chetvāna vajanti dhīrā, ",
  "dhp347:4": "anapekkhino sabbadukkhaṃ pahāya. ",
  "dhp348:0": "",
  "dhp348:1": "348. Muñca pure muñca pacchato, ",
  "dhp348:2": "majjhe muñca bhavassa pāragū; ",
  "dhp348:3": "Sabbattha vimuttamānaso, ",
  "dhp348:4": "na punaṃ jātijaraṃ upehisi. ",
  "dhp349:0": "",
  "dhp349:1": "349. Vitakkamathitassa jantuno, ",
  "dhp349:2": "tibbarāgassa subhānupassino; ",
  "dhp349:3": "Bhiyyo taṇhā pavaḍḍhati, ",
  "dhp349:4": "esa kho daḷhaṃ karoti bandhanaṃ. ",
  "dhp350:1": "350. Vitakkūpasame ca yo rato, ",
  "dhp350:2": "asubhaṃ bhāvayate sadā sato; ",
  "dhp350:3": "Esa kho byanti kāhiti, ",
  "dhp350:4": "esa checchati mārabandhanaṃ. ",
  "dhp351:0": "",
  "dhp351:1": "351. Niṭṭhaṅgato asantāsī, ",
  "dhp351:2": "vītataṇho anaṅgaṇo; ",
  "dhp351:3": "Acchindi bhavasallāni, ",
  "dhp351:4": "antimoyaṃ samussayo. ",
  "dhp352:1": "352. Vītataṇho anādāno, ",
  "dhp352:2": "niruttipadakovido; ",
  "dhp352:3": "Akkharānaṃ sannipātaṃ, ",
  "dhp352:4": "jaññā pubbāparāni ca; ",
  "dhp352:5": "Sa ve ‘‘antimasārīro, ",
  "dhp352:6": "mahāpañño mahāpuriso’’ti vuccati. ",
  "dhp353:0": "",
  "dhp353:1": "353. Sabbābhibhū sabbavidūhamasmi, ",
  "dhp353:2": "sabbesu dhammesu anūpalitto; ",
  "dhp353:3": "Sabbañjaho taṇhakkhaye vimutto, ",
  "dhp353:4": "sayaṃ abhiññāya kamuddiseyyaṃ. ",
  "dhp354:0": "",
  "dhp354:1": "354. Sabbadānaṃ dhammadānaṃ jināti, ",
  "dhp354:2": "sabbarasaṃ dhammaraso jināti; ",
  "dhp354:3": "Sabbaratiṃ dhammarati jināti, ",
  "dhp354:4": "taṇhakkhayo sabbadukkhaṃ jināti. ",
  "dhp355:0": "",
  "dhp355:1": "355. Hananti bhogā dummedhaṃ, ",
  "dhp355:2": "no ca pāragavesino; ",
  "dhp355:3": "Bhogataṇhāya dummedho, ",
  "dhp355:4": "hanti aññeva attanaṃ. ",
  "dhp356:0": "",
  "dhp356:1": "356. Tiṇadosāni khettāni, ",
  "dhp356:2": "rāgadosā ayaṃ pajā; ",
  "dhp356:3": "Tasmā hi vītarāgesu, ",
  "dhp356:4": "dinnaṃ hoti mahapphalaṃ. ",
  "dhp357:1": "357. Tiṇadosāni khettāni, ",
  "dhp357:2": "dosadosā ayaṃ pajā; ",
  "dhp357:3": "Tasmā hi vītadosesu, ",
  "dhp357:4": "dinnaṃ hoti mahapphalaṃ. ",
  "dhp358:1": "358. Tiṇadosāni khettāni, ",
  "dhp358:2": "mohadosā ayaṃ pajā; ",
  "dhp358:3": "Tasmā hi vītamohesu, ",
  "dhp358:4": "dinnaṃ hoti mahapphalaṃ. ",
  "dhp359:1": "359. (Tiṇadosāni khettāni, ",
  "dhp359:2": "icchādosā ayaṃ pajā; ",
  "dhp359:3": "Tasmā hi vigaticchesu, ",
  "dhp359:4": "dinnaṃ hoti mahapphalaṃ.) ",
  "dhp359:5": "Tiṇadosāni khettāni, taṇhādosā ayaṃ pajā; Tasmā hi vītataṇhesu, dinnaṃ hoti mahapphalaṃ. Taṇhāvaggo catuvīsatimo niṭṭhito. "
}
